# Claire Bible (`{{PLUGIN_NAME}}`)

Route every request to the matching subcommand below based on the explicit subcommand (`ingest`, `regenerate`, `query`) or the user's natural-language intent:

| Subcommand | Trigger / Intent | Section |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **`{{INGEST_CMD}}`** | Save/extract a URL, local file (`PDF`, `DOCX`, `ODT`, `MD`, `TXT`, `RST`, `ADOC`, `HTML`), or note; drain pending queue (`pending`); or re-fetch from URL (`재적재`) | [Ingest](#subcommand-ingest) |
| **`{{REGENERATE_CMD}}`** | Re-extract an existing document from its stored `raw_text` without re-fetching (`재생성`, `재추출`) | [Regenerate](#subcommand-regenerate) |
| **`{{QUERY_CMD}}`** | Discover KBs, search entities/relations, inspect documents, or contribute to shared KBs (`contrib_submit`) | [Query](#subcommand-query) |{{MODEL_HANDOFF_NOTE}}

